ed.","Known opening stop/target events resolve before later intrabar extremes. Otherwise stop-first for ambiguous OHLC; gap-through stops use the worse open, while favorable target gaps fill at the fixed target. No target fill on an entry bar. Stops remain active. Maximum hold 72 hours; predeclared fold boundaries flatten at the final bar open with both exit costs.","Drawdown uses hourly equity including estimated liquidation costs, not an intrabar worst-case path. No fees for idle cash, funding, shorting, leverage, tax or liquidity impact beyond fixed slippage.","Degradation and low-sample flags are descriptive; these short, single-symbol folds do not prove robustness, eliminate overfitting, or estimate a probability of future profit.","EMA 21/50 + RSI momentum, fold 1: training 2026-09-20T17:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-07T08:59:59.999Z, 21 trades, -7.406%; test 2026-10-07T09:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-12T21:59:59.999Z, 3 trades, -0.649% net.","EMA 21/50 + RSI momentum, fold 2: training 2026-09-20T17:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-12T21:59:59.999Z, 24 trades, -8.008%; test 2026-10-12T22:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-18T10:59:59.999Z, 4 trades, -3.174% net.","EMA 21/50 + RSI momentum, fold 3: training 2026-09-20T17:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-18T10:59:59.999Z, 28 trades, -10.927%; test 2026-10-18T11:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-24T00:59:59.999Z, 6 trades, -2.417% net.","EMA 21/50 + RSI momentum: low sample (13 out-of-sample trades; warning threshold 30).","EMA 50 + RSI pullback, fold 1: training 2026-09-20T17:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-07T08:59:59.999Z, 1 trades, -1.138%; test 2026-10-07T09:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-12T21:59:59.999Z, 0 trades, 0.000% net.","EMA 50 + RSI pullback, fold 2: training 2026-09-20T17:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-12T21:59:59.999Z, 1 trades, -1.138%; test 2026-10-12T22:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-18T10:59:59.999Z, 0 trades, 0.000% net.","EMA 50 + RSI pullback, fold 3: training 2026-09-20T17:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-18T10:59:59.999Z, 1 trades, -1.138%; test 2026-10-18T11:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-24T00:59:59.99